k--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1737</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/bc95e14be328303bb37e31299661b03045e37d07\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">bc95e14</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Added $bb_cfg[&#039;auto_language_detection&#039;] parametr (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1835\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1835</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/b550fa59f9ee96ca89e5b6db880147bc72841e93\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">b550fa5</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Easter egg for the 20th anniversary of the TorrentPier! (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1831\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1831</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/f2e513dd8b0f82f4f02474db4b83d83904a93f29\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">f2e513d</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Added configuration files for nginx &amp; caddy (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1787\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1787</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/f7d394607e4ea5bb9b7f2b33692204a226a4d78b\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">f7d3946</a>)</li>\n</ul><h3 class=\"bbHeading\"><a class=\"u-anchorTarget\" name=\"-bug-bug-fixes\"></a>🐛 Bug Fixes&#8203;<a class=\"hoverLink\" href=\"#-bug-bug-fixes\" title=\"Permanent link\"></a></h3><ul>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(info.php)</i> Undefined array key &quot;show&quot; (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1836\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\